    title: 'Eczema Explained: Why Skin Gets Itchy and Inflamed, and the Daily Habits That Help',
    excerpt:
      'Atopic eczema is common, uncomfortable and often misunderstood. What is happening in the skin, why moisturising is the foundation of care, which everyday triggers matter, and the signs that mean it is time to see a doctor.',
    date: '2026-10-13',
