    title: 'Keratosis Pilaris: The Rough “Chicken Skin” Bumps on Arms and Thighs, Explained',
    excerpt:
      'Those small, rough bumps on the backs of the arms are harmless and extremely common — and they are made worse by the very scrubbing most people try first. What keratosis pilaris is, what realistically helps, and what to expect.',
